ors, Hangman, and many more.\n\nAll familiar, but all TWISTED!\n\nPlay them all in any order.\n\n\"You have 15 minutes to complete it.\"\nIf you make too many mistakes or run out of time,\n\nYOU WILL BE PUNISHED!\n\nBe the good kid everyone expects you to be!", "summary": "The Ba B\u1ecb's game is a time limit challenge in the style of a haunted early 2000s educational software. Play as one of the unlucky kids trapped in this twisted game and help them make it out alive!", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/ba-bi", "videos": [{"id": 171031, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "837Ajew6yjc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=837Ajew6yjc", "title": "The BA B\u1eca game is now available on Steam and Itch", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/837Ajew6yjc/sddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 171073, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "EtU1ixp2Pfo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EtU1ixp2Pfo", "title": "The Ba B\u1ecb's game - Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EtU1ixp2Pfo/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}